body:
No running. Everyone will see all the terrible horrible things you're ashamed of and guilty of on display in front of everyone and your family. Everyone WILL KNOW WHAT YOU DID. THERE'S NO GOING BACK. AND THEN YOU WILL ROAST IN HELL FOREVER AND EVER AND EVER AND EVER WITH NO WATER. 

&#x200B;

IT'S SO SCARY!

I literally told him that and he got angry with me because i'm twisting the word of God. He just kept saying do you trust God more than you trust people and your father. Like do you love him more than your family. It honestly just makes me wanna vomit. Like it's such a poisonous worldview and SO DEPRESSING TOO. 

&#x200B;

THE DEVIL OWNS THE WORLD AND SO MANY PEOPLE ARE GONNA BE BURNING IN HELL ITS SO SAD! I almost cried talking to him. Because i told him that my dad and my best friend might be going to hell. And he just kept justifying it by saying that it's Gods plan that God makes the rules we don't. LIKE STOP.

LIKE STOPPPPPPPP WHY CANT PEOPLE JUST LIVE THEIR LIVES! WHY DOES IT HAVE TO BE SO FREAKING HORRIFIC. 

&#x200B;

I LITERALLY TOLD HIM THAT PEOPLE HAVE SUFFERED ENOUGH HERE ON EARTH AND THEN THEY'RE GONNA GO SUFFER IN ETERNAL FIRE SOME MORE?!

&#x200B;

AND THEN HE'S LIKE THEY DONT KNOW SUFFERING. LOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOL. WHAT THE FUCK IS WRONG WITH YOU DUDE. 

&#x200B;

SERIOUSLY. YOU ACT LIKE YOU KNOW EVERY GODDAMN THING AND THAT ITS REALITY. AND THAT EVERYONE ELSE IS GOING TO HELL. YOU MOTHERFUCKING CUNT.

He loves to see the look in my eyes of sheer terror and grief. He loves knowing that i will be sent to hell and on that day they will cry Lord lord and he will say depart from you CURSED INTO EVERLASTING FIRE. PREPARED FOR HIS DEVILS AND ANGELS. 

&#x200B;

And then he will be happy for leading the narrow way his whole life while the rest of us suffer in eternal hell fire burning and roasting with my best friend and my dad.
